      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Vodalian Arcanist is about to die in combat to Midnight Guard (1/3 vs 2/3). The player has Acrobatic Maneuver available at exactly 3 mana with the opponent fully tapped out. Casting it would save the Arcanist, draw a card, and trigger Distinguished Conjurer for 1 life — all pure upside. Instead, the player passes and lets the Arcanist die for nothing.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, allowing Vodalian Arcanist to die in combat.",
      "better_line": "Cast Acrobatic Maneuver targeting Vodalian Arcanist to save it from combat death, draw a card, and trigger Distinguished Conjurer for 1 life. The opponent is tapped out so there's no reason to hold the mana.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 80,
