      "decision_index": 68,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Valley attacked Vodalian Arcanist into Midnight Guard, presumably planning to save it with Acrobatic Maneuver, but then declined to cast the trick. The Arcanist dies in combat for nothing. Casting Acrobatic Maneuver would have saved the creature, drawn a card, triggered Distinguished Conjurer for 1 life, and the whole line was clearly the reason for the attack in the first place.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, letting Vodalian Arcanist die to Midnight Guard in combat.",
