    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed on casting Acrobatic Maneuver with 3 untapped mana and no other castable spells this turn. The spell would have drawn a card (cantrip value) and flickered Distinguished Conjurer for minimal but non-zero value. Instead, 3 mana goes completely unused.",
