      "decision_index": 85,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Casting Knightly Valor (a 5-mana aura) taps out completely into an opponent with 7 cards in hand and blue mana available. The opponent already had Leave in the Dust in their graveyard, suggesting they play bounce spells. If the enchanted creature gets bounced, it's a devastating 2-for-1. Additionally, the opponent could have Exclude if targeting a creature spell, though Knightly Valor isn't a creature spell.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Knightly Valor for 5 mana, tapping out completely",
      "better_line": "A safer line would be Gideon's Lawkeeper (1 mana) + Forced Worship on a blocker (2 mana) = 3 mana, leaving 2 mana open for Valorous Stance as protection. Or Lawkeeper + Dub on Skyhunter Patrol (4 mana total, leaving 1 open), which still makes a 4/5 flying first striker while keeping the aura investment smaller and deploying an additional creature.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 153,
      "player": "GPT53C Hothead",
      "decision_index": 125,
