    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Player chose Flicker of Fate ({1}{W}) over Acrobatic Maneuver ({2}{W}) to blink Distinguished Conjurer at end of turn. With exactly 3 untapped lands and no other use for the mana, Acrobatic Maneuver would have provided the same blink effect plus drawn a card. The extra mana would have gone to waste anyway.",
