    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Cast Exclude (counter target creature spell + draw) during their own postcombat main with no creature spell on the stack. Exclude requires a creature spell as a target - casting it here accomplishes nothing and wastes a valuable counterspell. Even if the game somehow allows it to resolve drawing a card, it's far better held for the opponent's turn to counter their next creature.",
