    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Magnanimous Magistrate (6 mana, slow value engine) while Teferi, Master of Time sits at 4 loyalty threatening to take over the game. The opponent was fully tapped out, making this an ideal window to kill Teferi.",
