    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to activate Teferi's +1 loyalty ability (draw a card, discard a card) during postcombat main phase. This is free card selection that also increases Teferi's loyalty from 4 to 5, making it harder for the opponent's Skyhunter Patrol to kill Teferi. Teferi can be activated once per turn, and skipping this turn's activation wastes an opportunity for card filtering with a 6-card hand that includes situational cards.",
