    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Attacking Teferi at 5 loyalty with 4 total power won't kill it (reduces to 1), and the opponent can -3 to phase out an attacker before damage, leaving Teferi at 3. Meanwhile, attacking the player at 12 life applies meaningful pressure. Either way Teferi likely uses -3, but going face deals real damage while Teferi's loyalty drops from its own usage.",
