    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Midnight Guard (2/3) attacks Teferi at 3 loyalty, dealing only 2 damage and leaving it at 1. The Skyhunter Patrol (4/5 with Dub, flying, first strike) can one-shot Teferi by itself since 4 > 3 loyalty. Sending the Midnight Guard at the player would deal 2 damage to their 14 life total while Skyhunter handles Teferi alone.",
